        "PMC9787501::web::022::3_3_2_microstructure_of_the_oxidated_lay"
      ],
      "same_system": "unclear"
    },
    {
      "text": "Aluminum will preferentially oxidize to Al₂O₃ during exposure to high-temperature oxidizing conditions.",
      "field": "mechanism",
