        "PMC9787501::web::022::3_3_2_microstructure_of_the_oxidated_lay"
      ],
      "same_system": "unclear"
    },
    {
      "text": "A continuous alumina scale acts as a diffusion barrier that reduces oxygen ingress into the bulk.",
